# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files.
#
# This repository commits the mirrored upstream ABAP trees (run/input/) and
# the generated core package (core/) - exactly the "ABAP or generated trees"
# CONVENTIONS §6 asks a .gitattributes for. A CRLF checkout that re-commits
# a mirror or a regenerated core would turn every line into a diff.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.abap text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonc text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
